        "official_en_sha256": "cc047fff1f0bf2a3f82c956e954343aa21f6af77a20dbfb66d4ece4e45119dfd"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "あれは帰らずの沼と言ってな。\r\n瘴気で満ちておる。\r\n命を捨てにいくようなものだぞ。",
        "official_en": "We call it the “Bog of No Return.” It’s rife with miasma. You’d be throwing your lives away if you attempt to cross it.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
